          <groundspeak:finder id="985002">Strider&#39;s Ride</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP635 	Dapp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were working our way back to Edmonton but there were still a few required stops to make.

Here at Dapp, I was serenaded by the howling of coyotes off in the distance, while using the flashlight  to navigate through the darkness over to the cap site. Very atmospheric.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTCap ofth&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
